Subject: [PATCH] docs: record what is out of scope for now

User decisions (2026-09-30):

- No dark mode for now; the single palette stays (PRD 6.2).
- No dynamic type for now (PRD 6.1).
- Board type cannot be changed in goal settings (PRD 4.4).
- Push notifications and monetization come later.
- The only real device is an iPhone 15 Pro (393pt); other widths and
  Android cannot be checked on hardware (HANDOFF 8, 9).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
